-- the minimal polynomial of M from S's characteristic polynomial p: p(λ) = λ^a r(λ²) with a the parity of its
-- degree (S's eigenvalues are 0 and pairs ±iμ), M's eigenvalues are the roots of r(−x), the μ², with 0 when
-- a = 1; so m = squarefree(x^a r(−x))
m-from-s : List SQ → List SQ
m-from-s p = squarefree (if odd (monus (poly-len p) (suc zero)) then poly-shift (suc zero) (alt-sign true (alt-take false p)) else alt-sign true (alt-take true p))
